EXPLAINATION:-
My ChatController acts as the main coordinator of the chatbot. First, it receives the user's message, session ID, and preferred language through a POST request. 
Then, it calls RagService to retrieve relevant blood donation guidelines and combines that context with the instructions from PromptBuilder. 
Next, it sends the combined prompt and user question to LlmService, which calls the Gemini API. 
The controller parses the JSON response to extract the reply and language, saves the chat details through ChatLogRepository, and returns the final response to the frontend.
